## Why This Is Asked
Assesses real-time streaming ML architecture, multi-tenant model isolation, and data governance within AWS's secure ML stack.

## Key Concepts
- Streaming inference patterns with Kinesis Data Streams
- SageMaker Multi-Model Endpoint for tenant isolation
- SageMaker Feature Store for per-tenant feature management
- PrivateLink and VPC for data residency compliance
- Automated drift detection and retraining workflows

## Code Example
```javascript
// Tenant routing to specific model in Multi-Model Endpoint
const invokeModel = async (tenantId, payload) => {
  const modelName = `model-${tenantId}`;
  const response = await sagemakerRuntime.invokeEndpoint({
    EndpointName: endpointName,
    TargetModel: modelName,
    ContentType: 'application/json',
    Body: JSON.stringify(payload)
  });
  return JSON.parse(response.Body);
};
```
